## 📱 DEPLOYMENT ROADMAP: PWA + MOBILE APP STRATEGY

### **Current Infrastructure (May 6, 2026):**
- **Frontend:** Vercel (https://wewatch.vercel.app) - Vite + React
- **Backend:** Railway (https://wewatch-production.up.railway.app) - Go + PostgreSQL
- **Storage:** Cloudflare R2 - Media files (videos, images, thumbnails)
- **Real-time:** LiveKit - Audio/video streaming + WebRTC

### **Production Domain Setup Plan:**

**Phase 1: Custom Domain Setup (IMMEDIATE - Next 2 Weeks)**
```
Target Production URLs:
├── wewatch.com (or your-domain.com) → Frontend on Vercel
├── api.wewatch.com → Backend on Railway
└── cdn.wewatch.com → Cloudflare R2 (optional, can use R2 direct URL)

Action Items:
1. ✅ Purchase domain (recommendations: wewatch.tv, wewatch.app, getonwewatch.com)
2. ✅ Add custom domain to Vercel (Dashboard → Domain Settings - FREE)
3. ✅ Add custom subdomain to Railway (api.your-domain.com)
4. ✅ Update all hardcoded URLs in code:
   - frontend/src/services/api.js → API_BASE_URL detection
   - OAuth redirect URIs (Google, Stripe, etc.)
   - CORS configuration in backend
   - JWT issuer/audience claims
5. ✅ Test everything on new production domain
```

**Why Custom Domain is Essential:**
- ✅ PWA requires HTTPS + custom domain for better "Add to Home Screen" experience
- ✅ Mobile app stores (Google Play, App Store) require domain verification
- ✅ Deep links for app-to-web require your domain
- ✅ Privacy policy/terms must be hosted on your domain
- ✅ User trust: "wewatch.com" > "wewatch.vercel.app"

**Keep Vercel + Railway Infrastructure Because:**
- ✅ CDN global edge network (faster than most VPS)
- ✅ Automatic HTTPS with custom domains
- ✅ Preview deployments for testing
- ✅ Zero config deployments (push to GitHub → auto deploy)
- ✅ PostgreSQL included with Railway
- ✅ WebSocket support built-in
- ✅ Scales automatically
- ❌ **DON'T** move to AWS/GCP/Azure (overkill for MVP)
- ❌ **DON'T** self-host on VPS (more maintenance, less reliable)

