**Handler Updates:**
- `CreatePost` - Host-only validation, calls broadcastRoomPostNotification
- `broadcastRoomPostNotification` - Fetches all room members, batches in 1000s, broadcasts via WebSocket
- `GetRoomTVAd` - Filters text/banner/image ads, checks frequency cap, updates last_ad_shown_at

**Frontend Implementation:**

**Files Modified (5):**
1. `PostUploadModal.jsx`:
   - Max video duration: 600s → 90s
   - Added room selection dropdown (fetches hosted rooms)
   - Passes room_id to POST /api/posts
   - Shows RoomTV notification message

2. `RoomTV.jsx`:
   - Added state: roomPosts, currentPostIndex, adContent, adDismissed, timers
   - Fetches room posts via GET /api/rooms/:id/posts?limit=5
   - Fetches RoomTV ads via GET /api/ads/roomtv
   - Post rotation: 10s intervals, 2 min total, auto-dismiss
   - Ad auto-dismiss: Uses ad.duration, default 15s
   - Click handler: navigate('/discover', { state: { openPost, autoPlay }})

3. `RoomPageNew.jsx`:
   - Added state: roomTVRefetchTrigger
   - WebSocket handler case: room_post_created
   - Shows toast notification when new post arrives
   - Increments refetch trigger to reload RoomTV
   - Passes refetchTrigger prop to RoomTV

4. `LobbyPage.jsx`:
   - Added location.state.openPost handler
   - Switches to discover sub-tab automatically
   - Fetches post via GET /api/posts/:id
   - Opens PostViewModal with autoPlay support
   - Clears navigation state after handling

5. `AdsManagementModal.jsx`:
   - New tab: "🔧 Master Switch" (default)
   - Fetches settings via GET /api/ads/settings
   - Updates via PUT /api/ads/settings (super admin)
   - Global master switch with large toggle
   - 3 granular toggles (Feed/Session/RoomTV)
   - Status summary panel

**Architecture Decisions:**
- Video Duration: 90 seconds max (social media style)
- Room Posting: Host-only (validated backend + UI)
- Broadcast: All members (batched 1000 per batch)
- RoomTV Duration: 2 mins for posts, 5 mins for events
- Post Rotation: 10s per post in carousel
- Ads Frequency: 1 hour cap per room
- Ads Types: Text/banner/image only in RoomTV
- Master Switch: Multiple rows for granular control

**Database Changes:**
- `ad_settings` table created (setting_key unique, enabled boolean)
- `rooms.last_ad_shown_at` field added (nullable timestamp)
- Migration added to AutoMigrate

**Testing Checklist:**
- ✅ Host uploads 90s video with room selected
- ✅ RoomTV shows "NEW POST FROM HOST" notification
- ✅ Click RoomTV → Opens in Discover with autoPlay
- ✅ Posts auto-dismiss after 2 minutes
- ✅ Super admin can toggle ads on/off
- ✅ RoomTV ads appear when idle (1-hour frequency)
- ✅ Room members receive WebSocket notification toast
- ✅ Posts show in UserProfileModal posts grid
- ✅ Recordings also trigger RoomTV notifications

**Revenue Impact:**
- RoomTV ads add new monetization channel with frequency cap
- Host posts increase engagement and session creation
- 90-second format encourages more uploads
- Seamless creator-to-viewer content flow

**Status:** Backend deployed, frontend integrated, WebSocket notifications working, READY FOR USERS! 🚀📺

