## 🔒 PRIVACY & SESSION VISIBILITY SYSTEM

### **Session Privacy Options:**

1. **Instant Watch Sessions (AccessModal.jsx)**
   - **Public Access**: Session visible to everyone in lobby, anyone can join
   - **Private Access**: Only members can see and join via invite link
   - **Session Privacy Checkbox**: "Hide from Lobby 'Watching Now'" - Session won't appear in lobby list unless you're a member (only direct links work)
   - **Content Rating**: Age-appropriate filtering (G, PG, PG-13, R, NC-17)

2. **Regular Room Sessions (LeftSidebar.jsx)**
   - **👻 Ghost Mode**: Hide session preview from lobby
     - Label: "Ghost Mode" (user-friendly rename from "Hide Preview from lobby")
     - Icon: Animated ghost emoji 👻 that scales on hover/click
     - Description: "content moderation - hide preview from public, use if not suitable for public to view."
     - When enabled: Session thumbnails won't appear in public lobby preview

### **Privacy UX Philosophy:**
- Ghost Mode uses friendly iconography instead of technical jargon
- Clear visual indicators help users understand privacy controls quickly
- Consistent privacy options across instant watch and regular sessions
- Content rating system prevents age-inappropriate content exposure
- Multiple layers of privacy: access type + lobby visibility + content rating

