**PHASE 4: Layout Cleanup on "End Live"**

**Issue 4**: Layout persists after clicking "End Live" button
- **Symptom**: Host clicks "End Live" → Host layout clears ✅ → Member layout stays (split-view boxes remain) ❌
- **Expected**: Both host and members should see blank screen when LiveShare ends

**Investigation**:
- **Host Side**: Works correctly
  - `handleEndScreenShare()` clears `selectedLiveShareLayout`, `liveShareContentMode`, `podcastConfig`
  - Location: `frontend/src/components/cinema/VideoWatch.jsx` (Lines 2647-2657)
  
- **Member Side**: No cleanup happening
  - Expected: `screen_share_stopped` WebSocket message
  - Reality: Only receives `update_room_status` message
  - Member never sees log: `🛑 [VideoWatch] screen_share_stopped received!`

**Root Cause**: Backend sends `update_room_status` but NOT `screen_share_stopped` for LiveShare
- Member receives: `{type: 'update_room_status', data: {is_screen_sharing: false, liveshare_mode: null}}`
- Member's `screen_share_stopped` handler never executes

**Fix 5: Layout Cleanup in update_room_status Handler** - `frontend/src/components/cinema/VideoWatch.jsx` (Lines 3101-3133)
```javascript
case "update_room_status":
  // ... existing media update logic ...
  
  // ✅ Clear ALL LiveShare layouts and media when host ends LiveShare
  // Works for: solo-view, split-view, panel-view, screen-share
  // Works for: camera, screen, both, podcast, news, show, church modes
  if (!message.data?.is_screen_sharing && message.data?.liveshare_mode === null) {
    console.log('🛑 [VideoWatch] LiveShare ended via update_room_status', {
      currentMediaType: currentMedia?.type,
      currentLayout: selectedLiveShareLayout,
      currentContentMode: liveShareContentMode,
      hasPodcastConfig: !!podcastConfig
    });
    
    // Clear media if it's LiveShare or screen share
    if (currentMedia?.type === 'liveshare' || currentMedia?.type === 'screen_share') {
      console.log('🧹 [VideoWatch] Clearing LiveShare media (any mode)');
      setCurrentMedia(null);
      setIsPlaying(false);
    }
    
    // Clear ALL LiveShare layout states (works for all layouts & modes)
    if (selectedLiveShareLayout || liveShareContentMode || podcastConfig) {
      console.log('🧹 [VideoWatch] Clearing ALL LiveShare states:', {
        layout: selectedLiveShareLayout,
        contentMode: liveShareContentMode,
        hasPodcastConfig: !!podcastConfig
      });
      setSelectedLiveShareLayout(null);
      setLiveShareContentMode(null);
      setPodcastConfig(null);
    }
    
    setIsScreenSharingActive(false);
    setScreenSharerUserId(null);
  }
  break;
```

**Also Enhanced screen_share_stopped Handler** (Lines 3159-3188) with comprehensive debug logging:
```javascript
case "screen_share_stopped":
  console.log('🛑 [VideoWatch] screen_share_stopped received!', {
    currentMediaType: currentMedia?.type,
    isScreenSharingActive,
    selectedLiveShareLayout,
    messageData: message.data
  });
  
  // Clear media for both LiveShare and WatchFrom screen sharing
  if (currentMedia?.type === 'screen_share' || currentMedia?.type === 'liveshare') {
    console.log('🧹 [VideoWatch] Clearing currentMedia (type:', currentMedia?.type, ')');
    setCurrentMedia(null);
  } else {
    console.log('⚠️ [VideoWatch] currentMedia type mismatch - not clearing. Type:', currentMedia?.type);
  }
  
  setIsPlaying(false);
  setIsScreenSharingActive(false);
  setScreenSharerUserId(null);
  
  console.log('🧹 [VideoWatch] Clearing LiveShare layout states');
  setSelectedLiveShareLayout(null);
  setLiveShareContentMode(null);
  setPodcastConfig(null);
  console.log('✅ [VideoWatch MEMBER] LiveShare layout and media cleared on host End Live');
  
  showNotification('Screen sharing ended', 'info');
  break;
```

**Result**: 
- ✅ Host clicks "End Live" → Backend broadcasts `update_room_status` with `liveshare_mode: null`
- ✅ Members receive message → Clear `currentMedia` → Clear `selectedLiveShareLayout`
- ✅ Split-view boxes disappear → Screen returns to blank state
- ✅ Works for ALL layouts: solo-view, split-view, panel-view, screen-share
- ✅ Works for ALL modes: camera, screen, both, podcast, news, show, church

