**Expected Benefits:**

1. **Better Quality:**
   - Host video: 720p-1080p (compressed by LiveKit)
   - Graphics: Vector/text rendered crisp at native resolution
   - No compression artifacts on ticker/banner text

2. **Lower Bandwidth:**
   - Without transmission: Host sends 2-4 Mbps video (graphics baked in)
   - With transmission: Host sends 1-3 Mbps video + 0.001 Mbps WebSocket
