- Ticker (input, add button, show/hide toggle)
- Banner (input, show/hide toggle, layout buttons)
- Preset buttons (Professional/Vibrant/Minimal)

**Button Patterns:**
```jsx
// Primary action buttons
className="w-full px-4 py-2 sm:px-5 sm:py-2.5 bg-orange-600 hover:bg-orange-700 text-white rounded-lg font-medium transition-colors"

// Secondary buttons
className="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 bg-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-600 border border-gray-600 rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-300 transition-colors"

// Small action buttons
