## Lobby Chat Redesign - Stacked Single-View (April 13, 2026) ✅

### Problem Statement
**Old Design:** Friends list + Messages shown side-by-side (split 35/65)
**Issue:** Too cramped on mobile, reduced readability, tight touch targets

### New Design: WhatsApp/Telegram Style
**Pattern:** Stacked single-view navigation (friends list → messages → back)

### Implementation

#### State Management
**File:** LobbyPage.jsx (lines 67-76)
```jsx
const [chatView, setChatView] = useState('friends'); // 'friends' | 'messages'
const [friendsSearchTerm, setFriendsSearchTerm] = useState(''); // Search friends
const [lastMessagePreviews, setLastMessagePreviews] = useState({}); // { userId: lastMessage }
const [onlineStatus, setOnlineStatus] = useState({}); // { userId: boolean }
```

#### Friends List View (Lines 3280-3600)
**Features:**
- ✅ Search bar at top with gradient header
- ✅ Large tap-friendly avatars (14×14 / 16×16)
- ✅ Online status indicators (green dot on avatar)
- ✅ Message previews with timestamps
- ✅ Unread message badges (99+ max)
- ✅ Visual distinction for unread (bold text)
- ✅ Checkmark for sent messages
- ✅ Tabs: Friends | Requests
- ✅ Ellipsis menu (unfriend, block)

**Design:**
```jsx
// Friend Card
<button onClick={() => handleOpenChat(friend)}>
  <Avatar size="16" withOnlineIndicator />
  <div>
    <Name /> <Timestamp />
    <LastMessage withCheckmark={isOwn} bold={unread > 0} />
  </div>
  <UnreadBadge count={unread} />
</button>
```

#### Messages View (Lines 3600-3820)
**Features:**
- ✅ Back button with arrow icon
- ✅ Friend avatar + name in header
- ✅ Online status in header ("● Online")
- ✅ Call button in header
- ✅ Full-width message thread
- ✅ Voice, attachments, stickers, polls support
- ✅ Touch gesture handlers (swipe-right to go back)

**Navigation:**
```jsx
handleOpenChat(friend) {
  setSelectedChatUser(friend);
  setChatView('messages'); // Switch view
}

handleBackToFriends() {
  setChatView('friends');
  setSelectedChatUser(null);
}
```

#### Message Preview Updates
**File:** LobbyPage.jsx (lines 950-995)
```jsx
const fetchChatMessages = async (userId) => {
  const messages = await api.get(`/api/lobby-chats/messages/${userId}`);
  
  // Save last message for preview
  if (messages.length > 0) {
    const lastMsg = messages[messages.length - 1];
    setLastMessagePreviews(prev => ({
      ...prev,
      [userId]: {
        text: lastMsg.message_type === 'text' ? lastMsg.message : `[${lastMsg.message_type}]`,
        timestamp: lastMsg.created_at,
        isOwn: lastMsg.sender_id === currentUser?.id
      }
    }));
  }
};
```

### Backend Support Files
- **lobby_chats.go**: 1-on-1 messaging API (text, voice, attachments, polls)
- **lobby_chat.go** (model): Message types, read receipts, edit/delete flags
- **friendships.go**: Friend requests, accept/reject, friend management
- **friendship.go** (model): pending/accepted/rejected states

### Mobile-First Design Principles
- Clean, uncluttered interface
- Large touch targets (3-4px padding)
- Full-screen views for better readability
- Smooth transitions between views
- Familiar navigation patterns

### Future Enhancements (Not Yet Implemented)
