### User Models

#### DateOfBirthPromptModal Component
**File**: `frontend/src/components/DateOfBirthPromptModal.jsx`
**Purpose**: Blocks access until user provides date of birth (COPPA compliance)

**Features:**
- Cannot be dismissed (modal without close button)
- Validates age is 13+ (platform minimum age)
- Prevents future dates
- Encrypted storage, never displayed publicly
- One-time setting (cannot be changed once set)

**Validation:**
```javascript
// Age 13+ required
const birthDate = new Date(dateOfBirth);
let age = today.getFullYear() - birthDate.getFullYear();
const monthDiff = today.getMonth() - birthDate.getMonth();
if (monthDiff < 0 || (monthDiff === 0 && today.getDate() < birthDate.getDate())) {
  age--;
}
if (age < 13) {
  setError('You must be at least 13 years old to use WeWatch');
}
```

#### User Model (Backend)
**File**: `backend/internal/models/user.go`

**Methods:**
- `GetAge()` - Calculates current age from DateOfBirth
- `CanViewContent(contentRating string) bool` - Checks if user age meets content rating requirement
- `HasDateOfBirth()` - Returns true if DOB is set

**Database Fields:**
- `date_of_birth` - Date field (nullable, set once)
- Encrypted and private (never in API responses except auth context)

