#### Design Decisions
1. **When to show**: After session ends (not during session) to avoid disrupting experience
2. **Optional review**: Only rating required to reduce friction
3. **One rating per session**: Prevents spam, unique constraint enforced
4. **No edit after submit** (initial version): Simpler implementation, can add later
5. **Mobile-first responsive**: Primary use case is mobile device viewing
6. **Skip option**: Always available - no forced rating
7. **Toast notifications**: Non-intrusive feedback using existing toast system

