### **4. Lecture Hall LiveShare Auto-Discussion Mode**

#### Auto-Enable Discussion Mode with LiveShare
**File**: `frontend/src/pages/LectureHallPage.jsx`

**Purpose**: Match 3D Cinema behavior - auto-enable discussion when LiveShare starts, auto-restore previous state when ends

**Implementation:**

**1. State Storage (Line 1072):**
```javascript
const previousDiscussionModeRef = useRef(null); // Store discussion mode state before LiveShare
```

**2. Auto-Enable on LiveShare Start (Line 6320-6324):**
```javascript
const handleLiveShareModeSelect = (mode) => {
  // ... existing code ...
  
  // ✅ AUTO-ENABLE DISCUSSION MODE when LiveShare starts
  if (isHost && !discussionMode) {
    previousDiscussionModeRef.current = discussionMode; // Store current state
    toggleDiscussionMode(); // Enable discussion mode
    console.log('🎤 [LiveShare] Auto-enabled discussion mode');
  }
};
```

**3. Auto-Restore on LiveShare End (Line 6224-6231):**
```javascript
const handleEndScreenShare = () => {
  // ... existing cleanup ...
  
  // ✅ AUTO-DISABLE DISCUSSION MODE when LiveShare ends (restore previous state)
  if (isHost && previousDiscussionModeRef.current !== null) {
    const shouldRestore = previousDiscussionModeRef.current;
    if (discussionMode !== shouldRestore) {
      toggleDiscussionMode();
      console.log(`🎤 [LiveShare] Discussion mode restored to: ${shouldRestore}`);
    }
    previousDiscussionModeRef.current = null;
  }
};
```

**4. Backend Sync (Line 4829):**
```javascript
// Members receive discussion_mode_changed WebSocket updates
case 'discussion_mode_changed':
  const newMode = msg.discussion_mode;
  setDiscussionMode(newMode);
  console.log('🎤 Discussion mode updated:', newMode);
  break;
```

**Backend Handler**: `backend/internal/handlers/websocket.go` (lines 5000-5055)
- `toggle_discussion_mode` message type
- Verifies sender is host
- Updates `watch_sessions.discussion_mode` in database
- Broadcasts `discussion_mode_changed` to all room members

**Result**: Seamless LiveShare experience - discussion mode automatically enables for presentations, restores to previous state when done

