@keyframes ghostGlow {
  0%, 100% { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4)); }
  50% { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 16px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.7)); }
}
```

**3. Gradient Styling:**
- **Container**: Gradient background (from-[#D9D9D9]/10 to-[#D9D9D9]/5)
- **Border**: Purple border with hover state (border-purple-500/20 → border-purple-500/40)
- **Title**: Gradient text (from-purple-400 via-pink-400 to-purple-400)
- **Active Badge**: Pulse animation when `hidePreviewThumbnails` is true

**4. Description Text:**
```
🔒 Content moderation - Hide from public view.
Use for sensitive or private content.
```

**Component Structure:**
```jsx
<div className="ghost-mode-container">
  <style jsx>{/* CSS animations */}</style>
  
  <div className="flex items-center gap-3">
    <span className="ghost-icon ghost-float ghost-entrance ghost-glow">👻</span>
    <div>
      <span className="gradient-text">Ghost Mode</span>
      {hidePreviewThumbnails && (
        <span className="active-badge animate-pulse">ACTIVE</span>
      )}
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <p className="description">🔒 Content moderation - Hide from public view.</p>
</div>
```

**User Experience:**
- Ghost icon slides up and bounces when sidebar opens
- Continuous gentle hover animation (up/down motion)
- Purple glow pulse effect for mystical appearance
- Professional gradient theming throughout
- Clear active state indicator
- Shortened, concise description text

